# ── Claude Code and Codex ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The two third-party coding CLIs this image ships. The stand's convenience,
# not part of Cmdop.
#
# Copy to `env/agents.env`.

# Codex sandboxes every command through bubblewrap, which a container often
# cannot create. "auto" probes it at startup; pin it to decide yourself.
# See docs/coding-agents.md.
CMDOP_CODEX_SANDBOX=auto
